  "description": "An abandoned slum in the middle of a desolate land.  \nUrban developers show up in Jack's town and demand he leave.  \nAll he had was debt and poverty. It is an extremely insufficient asset to leave immediately after three months.  \nThen, an accidental opportunity came to him. He says that if he lives as a vampire hunter, he can make quite a bit of money.  \nWith nowhere to back down, he rushes into life as a hunter without hesitation.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=791675), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8231599)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003055)",
